{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"Ill be in the pond... the letter is in the chest in the hut\"  He heads off and leaps into the pond.\n\nThe Letter is on top of all his stuff in his chest and says:\n||Dear Ophelia,\n    The brightest part of my day, is spending my evenings with you.  Each time I see you, my heart skips.  My pain subsides.  Simply put, you have filled a hole in me that I though unfillable.  There is much about me you still do not know, and much of you I still do not know.  But I would gladly as long as it takes to learn it.  You have made me realize; I cannot spend my life separate from others.  I cannot continue to deny that I need companionship.  Last night, I had nightmares of everyone dying, and being the last survivor again.  When I awoke, you were the first person I thought of, and realized my mind is afraid of losing you.  It is telling me I need to let you in.\n\nSimply put, I wish to walk by you.  In whatever fashion you see fit.\n\n-Gil||","created_at":"2020-08-07T02:08:06.902000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741115426355806258","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"Ophelia knows there is something there but not knowing how to express it and the fear of getting close to someone losing them. She finds a piece of paper and writes. \n||Im not sure how to express myself. I know i need to let others in as well but dont know how. Please don't take me walking away now as a no. I need at least until the morning to process everything.\"||\nSee sets it where he would see and then heads home.","created_at":"2020-08-07T02:30:13.899000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741120992184762449","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
