{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"<@237577351532249110>\n\nYou go for a rest but begin experiencing the hag's curse upon you. \n\nSandigil is walking on the shore and decides to go swim under the waves. The water around him is choppy and rough, it is becoming very difficult to swim without being pushed around by the current. Sandigil gets swept into the kelp forest, he looks around franticly and find himself surrounded by screams, is that Ophelia's voice? Is she drowning somewhere? As he swims through the kelp, Archivist Daysong appears putting an air bubble around ophelia and having her float up safely. He goes to you and grabs your arm to follow. He is dressed in the 50s onesie striped bathing suit and gives you a thumbs up and a wink when you make it ashore. He then walks into the sunset and you are left alone with your dream of ophelia.\n\nYou were cursed by the hags, but don't suffer any effects. Your exhaustion is cured and you are at full hp. Blessed be to daysong","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:11:12.334000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741221900574785597","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
