{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"Its about... my history\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T17:12:23.722000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741342995953221632","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"Yes. I'd like to here about it. What made you you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T17:15:08.819000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741343688420098233","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"leans in to Ophelia a bit \"when I was... what humans would say 14 years old.... my school started dying of a scale rot.  It was a slow and painful death... and we didn't have any way of slowing it or stopping it.  I had already started a life as one of the faithful.... which are often the leaders in my tribe.\" he pauses a second \"No prayer.... no divine intervention could cure those afflicted..... It wasnt passed through touch... to be honest... I don't know how it passed....\" sighs \"I spent 5 years tending to the ill.... until the last priest above me caught it..... I spent the next 4 years... traveling to every tribe... even spent some time in these lands.... looking for a cure.... I traveled basically alone... no one to trust.... if a group was heading from one place to the next.... I would go with them.  I would travel back to the twin vents when I could.... more dead... always more dead\" he takes a long pause","created_at":"2020-08-07T17:22:27.823000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741345529736462417","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"She listens carefully","created_at":"2020-08-07T17:24:03.961000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741345932968329266","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"I lost count of the years spent, as Elder Priest... it was my duty to save them.... but I never found anything.... the last time I made it home... there were.... creatures controlling those that were left.... the few survivors... 12... gathered what supplies they could and sent me off to find a new home..... i went east this time instead of west.... took me a very long time....\" shakes his head and waits a moment \"I had to grow up... without people.... in a way.... the people in Europe saw as a pet... even the land i was given was just so the king had claim to the oceans I was from....  anyway... I know how to help others.... but I didn't learn how to help myself.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T17:26:56.730000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741346657613905994","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
